<title>MALAYSIA: MALAYSIA JULY PALM OIL OUTPUT 823,000T-  IVAN.</title>
<headline>MALAYSIA JULY PALM OIL OUTPUT 823,000T-  IVAN.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's crude palm oil in July was projected to have risen 4.5 percent to 823,000 tonnes, private forecaster, Ivan Wong said on THursday.</p>
<p>Wong also kept his end-July stocks unchanged at his previous level of 805,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>Malaysia's Palm Oil Registration and Licensing Authority (PORLA) is scheduled to release the official July export/stock/output data on Friday.</p>
</text>
